parm step3_input.parm7
trajin reduced.nc
reference prod.xtc
center origin :1-198
image origin center
strip :WAT
rms reference mass :1-198@CA,C,N out RMSD.out
matrix covar name matrixdat @CA out covmat-ca.dat
analyze matrix matrixdat out evecs-ca.dat vecs 198
analyze matrix matrixdat name evecs-ca vecs 198
analyze modes fluct out analyzemodesflu.dat stack evecs-ca beg 1 end 198
analyze modes displ out analyzemodesdis.dat stack evecs-ca beg 1 end 198
run

projection modes evecs-ca.dat out pca1.dat beg 1 end 3 @CA
run